msgid "**Common site config:** the configurator writes ``db_host``, ``db_port``, the three redis URLs, ``socketio_port`` and ``host_name`` from ``ERPNEXT_COMMON_SITE_CONFIG`` into ``common_site_config.json``. Every deploy waits until the file holds the declared values and restarts the Frappe processes when they differ from the revision recorded in ``sites/.common_site_config.revision`` at the last restart, for example after a rotated redis password. A site without that file restarts once."
