msgid "**Generated credentials**: `meta/secrets.yml` as in [`web-app-openclaw`](../../roles/web-app-openclaw/meta/secrets.yml)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Generated credentials:** Every service account password and the manager cluster key come from [secrets.yml](./meta/secrets.yml)."
