# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**सूची फ़ोल्डर्स।** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) कॉल [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), जो प्रति राउंड एक फ़ोल्डर बनाता है `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (बस `<inventory-dir>` जब एक एकल दौर होता है)प्रत्येक फ़ोल्डर के लिए, `build_dev_inventory` राउंड के प्रति ऐप वैरिएंट पेलोड को हल करता है और इसे सूची में बेक करता है `host_vars` जैसा `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` ओवरराइड्स। इसलिए सूची डिस्क पर अलग-अलग है; कोई रनटाइम चयनकर्ता की आवश्यकता नहीं है।"

