msgid "**Role Groups:** `files/elixir/rbac.exs <./files/elixir/rbac.exs>`__ creates the Keycloak accounts of the ``administrator`` and ``moderator`` role group members that have none yet and sets the role of every Keycloak account to administrator, moderator or user from its groups. The platform administrator keeps its role. `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ runs it through ``mobilizon rpc`` as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change in Keycloak or LDAP reaches Mobilizon within one timer interval."
