msgid "**Role Mapping:** Every realm user signs in as a regular Gitea user. Members of the `administrator` role group become Gitea administrators and members of the `restricted` role group become restricted users at each sign-in, through the LDAP admin and restricted filters and through the admin and restricted groups of the OIDC source, which reads the groups claim."
