msgid "**Role catalogue:** [catalogue.py](../../utils/roles/rbac/catalogue.py) builds the roles of every deployed application from its `meta/rbac.yml` when the role deploys. The catalogue preselects the least-privileged role and marks administrator roles. A role is an administrator role when its name is `administrator` or ends in `-administrator`, or when it carries `realm_management` roles, such as `user-manager` of [web-app-keycloak](../web-app-keycloak/meta/rbac.yml)."
