msgid "**Role group sync:** With SSO or LDAP, [files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql](./files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql) runs through `psql` in the database container as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change reaches Semaphore within one timer interval. The same run creates every member of the `administrator` and `operator` role groups that has an e-mail and no account yet as an external Semaphore account, admin only for `administrator`, so a member added between deploys has its account within one timer interval."
