msgid "**Shared form.** Where one form serves local and LDAP accounts (Gitea, Open WebUI, Matrix, MinIO, Semaphore, Zammad, Odoo), the LDAP mode keeps the form for LDAP, and `native: false` means no local account signs in except the break-glass admin wherever the app can tell the two apart; where it cannot, the role README states that the form is shared."
