# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On (SSO) / OpenID Connect (OIDC):** Seamless integration with external identity providers for centralized authentication."
msgstr "**एकल साइन-ऑन (SSO) ओपनआईडी कनेक्ट (ओआईडीसी):** केंद्रीकृत प्रमाणीकरण के लिए बाहरी पहचान प्रदाताओं के साथ निर्बाध एकीकरण।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Frontend and controller share one Keycloak client and realm."
msgstr "**एकल साइन-ऑन:** फ्रंटेंड और कंट्रोलर एक साझा करें Keycloak ग्राहक और रियल्म।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Users authenticate once via Keycloak and reuse the session across the platform."
msgstr "**एकल साइन-ऑन:** उपयोगकर्ता एक बार के माध्यम से प्रमाणीकरण करते हैं Keycloak और मंच पर सत्र का पुन: उपयोग करें।."

msgid "**Single Sign-On:** With Keycloak deployed, the login page offers a Keycloak sign-in through the GPL-3.0 [RebelOIDC](https://github.com/Digitalist-Open-Cloud/Matomo-Plugin-RebelOIDC) plugin, which the custom image ships and the deploy activates. The OIDC username claim names the Matomo login, an existing account with that login is linked on first sign-in, and the sign-out also ends the Keycloak session. Signup is off, so only accounts the deploy provisioned can sign in. The local superuser keeps its password login behind the break-glass URL."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single Sign-On:** With Keycloak deployed, the login page offers a Keycloak sign-in through the GPL-3.0 `RebelOIDC <https://github.com/Digitalist-Open-Cloud/Matomo-Plugin-RebelOIDC>`__ plugin, which the custom image ships and the deploy activates. The OIDC username claim names the Matomo login, an existing account with that login is linked on first sign-in, and the sign-out also ends the Keycloak session. Signup is off, so only accounts the deploy provisioned can sign in. The local superuser keeps its password login behind the break-glass URL."
msgstr ""

