msgstr "**एकल कुंजी, प्रति ऐप उप डोमेन:** एक छिपी हुई सेवा प्रत्येक ऐप पर कार्य करती है ``<app>.<node>.onion``, OpenResty द्वारा होस्ट किया गया।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single logic for all roles**"
msgstr "**सभी भूमिकाओं के लिए एकल तर्क**"

msgid "**Single point of truth:** ``email.provider`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ selects the provider; ``MAIL_PROVIDER`` and the ``mail_provider`` and ``email`` lookups derive from it."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single point of truth:** `email.provider` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) selects the provider; `MAIL_PROVIDER` and the `mail_provider` and `email` lookups derive from it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single points of truth, enforced by lint.** The new *sys-lint* role pins the GitHub-release lint tools. Every mount target has one spot in *meta/volumes.yml* and container paths are derived from it, *default.env* is the enforced source of the primary domain, *container_backup* is rejected where no volume exists, and role credentials live at *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters no longer read gitignored build output, comments are checked in every file rather than only changed ones, and every shipped script requires a mirrored unit test."
msgstr "**सत्य के एकल बिंदु, लिंट द्वारा लागू।** नया *sys-lint* भूमिका गिटहब-रिलीज लिंट टूल को पिन करती है। प्रत्येक माउंट लक्ष्य में एक स्थान है *meta/volumes.yml* और कंटेनर पथ इसे से व्युत्पन्न हैं, *default.env* प्राथमिक डोमेन का लागू स्रोत है, *container_backup* अस्वीकार कर दिया गया है जहां कोई मात्रा मौजूद नहीं है और भूमिका क्रेडेंशियल में रहते हैं *meta/secrets.yml*लिंटर्स ने अब गिटाइनोर्ड बिल्ड आउटपुट को पढ़ा नहीं है, टिप्पणियों को केवल परिवर्तित लोगों के बजाय हर फाइल में चेक किया जाता है, और प्रत्येक भेजी गई स्क्रिप्ट को मिरर यूनिट टेस्ट की आवश्यकता होती है।"

msgid "**Single run per cluster:** in swarm the timer only uses the container of task slot 1."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on across protocols and domains.** Keycloak imports a SAML client for every app that asks for one; SuiteCRM authenticates against it via SAML instead of a proxy, and Shopware provisions its admin through AdminOpenAuth with the front and back channel split. Sessions are shared across app domains, the issuer is pinned to the canonical OIDC URL, each consumer's redirect scheme resolves on its own side, and the logout sweep runs where the visitor is looking. Directory users are read through one lookup so seeding cannot diverge."
msgstr "**प्रोटोकॉल और डोमेन में सिंगल साइन-ऑन।** Keycloak प्रत्येक ऐप के लिए SAML क्लाइंट आयात करता है जो एक के लिए पूछता है; SuiteCRM एक प्रॉक्सी के बजाय SAML के माध्यम से इसके खिलाफ अधिकृत करता है, और Shopware व्यवस्थापक OpenAuth के माध्यम से आगे और पीछे के चैनल विभाजन के साथ प्रावधान करता है। सत्र ऐप डोमेन में साझा किए जाते हैं, जारीकर्ता को कैनोनिकल ओआईडीसी यूआरएल पर पिन किया जाता है, प्रत्येक उपभोक्ता की रीडायरेक्ट स्कीम अपनी तरफ से हल करती है, और लोगोट स्वीप रन जहां आगंतुक देख रहा है। निर्देशिका उपयोगकर्ताओं को एक लुकअप के माध्यम से पढ़ा जाता है ताकि बीजिंग को विविधता नहीं मिल सके।."

msgid "**Single sign-on through the proxy header:** with the oauth2-proxy gate active, ``files/shell/ldap/bootstrap.sh`` sets ``fdLoginMethod: LoginHTTPHeader`` and reads the user name from the ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`` header that the vhost always overwrites from the oauth2-proxy identity. Without the gate it sets ``LoginPost``, so FusionDirectory shows its own login form. Both values are reconciled on every deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on through the proxy header:** with the oauth2-proxy gate active, `files/shell/ldap/bootstrap.sh` sets `fdLoginMethod: LoginHTTPHeader` and reads the user name from the `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header that the vhost always overwrites from the oauth2-proxy identity. Without the gate it sets `LoginPost`, so FusionDirectory shows its own login form. Both values are reconciled on every deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the editor and admits only members of the administrator and agent-user groups of this application."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the ``administrator`` and ``mcp`` role groups of this application (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml``). Every other Keycloak user, biber included, gets a 403 from the proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the `administrator` and `mcp` role groups of this application (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml`). Every other Keycloak user, biber included, gets a 403 from the proxy."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-Site path**: the claim MUST contain `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` entries. The highest-privilege role across all matches wins (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). When no entry matches, the user's role is set to `subscriber` as a deterministic fallback."
msgstr "**एकल साइट पथ**: दावा MUST में शामिल हैं `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` प्रविष्टियाँ सभी मैचों की जीत में सर्वोच्च-निजी भूमिका (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). जब कोई प्रविष्टि मैच नहीं होता है तो उपयोगकर्ता की भूमिका को निर्धारित किया जाता है। `subscriber` एक निश्चित गिरावट के रूप में।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-container deployment** via Docker Compose."
msgstr "**एकल कंटेनर तैनाती** Docker Compose."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-manager bootstrap:** Initialises the cluster on the manager with the configured advertise address; idempotent on re-runs."
msgstr "**एकल प्रबंधक बूटस्ट्रैप:** कॉन्फ़िगर किए गए विज्ञापन पते के साथ प्रबंधक पर क्लस्टर शुरू करना; फिर से रनों पर विचार करना।"

msgid "**Single-node Wazuh stack:** Manager, indexer, and dashboard at the versions pinned in [services.yml](./meta/services.yml)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single-node Wazuh stack:** Manager, indexer, and dashboard at the versions pinned in `services.yml <./meta/services.yml>`__."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-owner model:** One privileged identity, gated by ``req.session.loggedIn``."
msgstr "**एकल मालिक मॉडल:** एक विशेषाधिकार प्राप्त पहचान, गेट द्वारा ``req.session.loggedIn``।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-owner model:** One privileged identity, gated by `req.session.loggedIn`."
msgstr "**एकल मालिक मॉडल:** एक विशेषाधिकार प्राप्त पहचान, गेट द्वारा `req.session.loggedIn`।"

msgid "**Site Administrators:** ``config.admin_email`` lists the platform administrator and every member of the ``administrator`` role group, so these accounts reach the admin panel."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Site Administrators:** `config.admin_email` lists the platform administrator and every member of the `administrator` role group, so these accounts reach the admin panel."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Size-Gated Docker Prune:** Removes every unused image and the build cache with ``container system prune -a -f`` only while a filesystem exceeds ``SIZE_PERCENT_CLEANUP_DISC_SPACE``; below it, ``container system prune -f`` removes stopped containers, unused networks, dangling images and dangling build cache."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Size-Gated Docker Prune:** Removes every unused image and the build cache with `container system prune -a -f` only while a filesystem exceeds `SIZE_PERCENT_CLEANUP_DISC_SPACE`; below it, `container system prune -f` removes stopped containers, unused networks, dangling images and dangling build cache."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Sized limits:** The deploy refuses container limits (``cpus``, ``mem_limit``) below the warm pool plus ``agents.max_running`` times the largest agent VM size plus ``services.proxmox.agents.overhead``, and a host whose free memory or storage is below that demand plus ``services.proxmox.agents.reserve``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Sized limits:** The deploy refuses container limits (`cpus`, `mem_limit`) below the warm pool plus `agents.max_running` times the largest agent VM size plus `services.proxmox.agents.overhead`, and a host whose free memory or storage is below that demand plus `services.proxmox.agents.reserve`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Skipped paths:** `.md` and `.rst` files and everything under `tests/` outside `roles/<role>/...` neither seed a role nor widen the deploy."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Execution Logic**"
msgstr "**स्मार्ट एक्सीक्यूशन लॉजिक**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Execution Logic**   Prevents multiple runs in one play by setting a `run_once_sys_ctl_cln_certs` fact."
msgstr "**स्मार्ट एक्सीक्यूशन लॉजिक** एक खेल में एकाधिक रनों को रोकता है `run_once_sys_ctl_cln_certs` तथ्य"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Injection**"
msgstr "**स्मार्ट इंजेक्शन**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smart Injection**   Uses NGINX's `sub_filter` to insert the tracking and theming snippets right before the closing `</head>` tag of your HTML documents."
msgstr "**स्मार्ट इंजेक्शन** NGINX का उपयोग करता है `sub_filter` समापन से पहले ट्रैकिंग और थीमिंग स्निपेट्स को सही करने के लिए `</head>` अपने HTML दस्तावेज़ों का टैग।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Smoother inventory creation:** Inventory and credential generation now work consistently after refactors, without brittle path assumptions."
msgstr "**चिकना सूची निर्माण:** इन्वेंटरी और क्रेडेंशियल पीढ़ी अब रिफैक्टर्स के बाद लगातार काम करती है, बिना ब्रिटल पथ धारणाओं के।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** on a btrfs data root the whole run is captured from one atomic filesystem snapshot with no container stopped; the host is probed before every run and falls back to the live copy when a snapshot would not be faithful."
msgstr "**स्नैपशॉट-aware:** एक btrfs डेटा जड़ पर पूरे रन को एक परमाणु फ़ाइलसिस्टम स्नैपशॉट से पकड़ा जाता है जिसमें कोई कंटेनर बंद नहीं होता है; मेजबान को हर रन से पहले जांचा जाता है और जब एक स्नैपशॉट वफादार नहीं होगा तो लाइव कॉपी में वापस गिर जाता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
msgstr "**स्नैपशॉट-aware:** हिन्दी `--link-dest` पिछले स्थानीय स्नैपशॉट के खिलाफ अपरिवर्तित फ़ाइलों को डुप्लिकेट करता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync `--link-dest` against the previous snapshot keeps storage growth proportional to actual change."
msgstr "**स्नैपशॉट-aware:** हिन्दी `--link-dest` पिछले स्नैपशॉट के खिलाफ वास्तविक परिवर्तन के अनुपात में भंडारण वृद्धि रहती है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` against the previous local snapshot deduplicates unchanged files."
msgstr "**स्नैपशॉट-aware:** हिन्दी ``--link-dest`` पिछले स्थानीय स्नैपशॉट के खिलाफ अपरिवर्तित फ़ाइलों को डुप्लिकेट करता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Snapshot-aware:** rsync ``--link-dest`` against the previous snapshot keeps storage growth proportional to actual change."
msgstr "**स्नैपशॉट-aware:** हिन्दी ``--link-dest`` पिछले स्नैपशॉट के खिलाफ वास्तविक परिवर्तन के अनुपात में भंडारण वृद्धि रहती है।"

msgid "**Source redaction:** the shared `LOG_REDACTION_RULES` of [22_logging.yml](../../group_vars/all/22_logging.yml) run as `stage.replace` stages before a line leaves the host; the Loki gateway applies them again."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Source redaction:** the shared ``LOG_REDACTION_RULES`` of `22_logging.yml <../../group_vars/all/22_logging.yml>`__ run as ``stage.replace`` stages before a line leaves the host; the Loki gateway applies them again."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sovereign File Sync and Share:** Self-host file sync, shares, and collaborative spaces under your own domain."
msgstr "**Sovereign फ़ाइल सिंक और शेयर:** अपने डोमेन के तहत सेल्फ-होस्ट फ़ाइल सिंक, शेयर और सहयोगी स्थान।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sovereign Video Conferencing:** Self-host meetings under your own domain without external SaaS dependency."
msgstr "**वीडियो कॉन्फ्रेंसिंग:** बाहरी सास निर्भरता के बिना अपने स्वयं के डोमेन के तहत स्व-होस्ट मीटिंग।"

msgid "**Speed is measured at deploy time, not declared, and only for a model that has no rate yet.** A rate is a property of this machine under this load, not of the model, so no catalogue carries one and a hand-written number in `services.yml` would be a guess that rots. After the gateway is warm, [measure_speed.py](../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/python/measure_speed.py) asks it which models it serves and sends one warm-up request plus `services.litellm.router.speed.samples` (12) measured requests to each unranked one, taking their median as output tokens per second. The warm-up is discarded at every setting, including a one-sample run: a rate that still carries the model load time ranks a small model below a larger one, and the router then routes on that inversion."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Split.** Generic behaviour lives in port-ui (repository `kevinveenbirkenbach/portfolio`, image `ghcr.io/kevinveenbirkenbach/port-ui`): frame, corners, folder view, navigation state, search, favourites, recent list, shortcuts, counts, density toggle, badge rendering, accessibility and the interface strings. Infinito.Nexus specifics live in `roles/web-app-dashboard` and the roles that produce its data: the taxonomy, the tag assignment, the activation switch, the corporate color, the RBAC mapping, the health source and the Semaphore pause state. Without the new configuration sections port-ui renders exactly as before."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Split.** `roles/web-app-erpnext` carries only what holds for every tenant: SSO and LDAP sign-in, the RBAC role mapping, the login methods of 064, the API bot, the server-script switch and the company bootstrap. The store commerce structure (GUI, `web-app-cst-store`) and the security-check structure (Security, `web-app-cst-security-check`) are Infinito.Nexus-internal; they live in their own repositories and roles and are created at runtime against the core site."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stabilized multi-distro CI deploys** with per-distro orchestration, two-pass *ASYNC* testing, hard cleanup between runs, and a global execution time budget"
msgstr "**स्थिर बहु-distro CI तैनाती** प्रति-डिस्ट्रो ऑर्केस्ट्रेशन के साथ, दो-पास *एसवाईएनसी* परीक्षण, रनों के बीच हार्ड क्लीनअप और वैश्विक निष्पादन समय बजट"

msgid "**Stack addressing**: one compose helper with `-p` and `-f` for every call, explicit default project name, `INFINITO_STACK_NAME`, slots owned by stacks."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Stack:** TypeScript + Svelte (with some Astro). `pnpm` monorepo."
msgstr "**स्टैक:** टाइपस्क्रिप्ट + velte (कुछ एस्ट्रो)। `pnpm` मोनोरेपो।"

msgid "**Stacks**: group containers, volumes and networks by their `com.docker.compose.project` label and map each project to its worktree with `git worktree list`. A stack consists of the DinD container, its `-coredns` sidecar, the volumes `<project>_docker` (the nested Docker of the whole deployment), `<project>_infinito`, `<project>_letsencrypt`, the network `<project>_default` and the image `<project>/debian:latest`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Staff Flags At Sign-In:** The role-local plugin [files/ruby/plugins/infinito-rbac-login/plugin.rb](./files/ruby/plugins/infinito-rbac-login/plugin.rb) applies the same rules to the account that signs in through OIDC, read from the `groups` claim of that sign-in, so a role-group change reaches the account at its next sign-in instead of the next timer run, and a first sign-in creates the account with its flags. A sign-in without a `groups` claim changes nothing, and the platform administrator is never touched."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Staff Flags At Sign-In:** The role-local plugin `files/ruby/plugins/infinito-rbac-login/plugin.rb <./files/ruby/plugins/infinito-rbac-login/plugin.rb>`__ applies the same rules to the account that signs in through OIDC, read from the ``groups`` claim of that sign-in, so a role-group change reaches the account at its next sign-in instead of the next timer run, and a first sign-in creates the account with its flags. A sign-in without a ``groups`` claim changes nothing, and the platform administrator is never touched."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Staff Flags From RBAC:** [files/ruby/reconcile_staff.rb](./files/ruby/reconcile_staff.rb) grants the admin flag to the members of the `administrator` role group and the moderator flag to the members of the `moderator` role group, and revokes both from every other account, as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer. The platform administrator keeps the admin flag."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Staff Flags From RBAC:** `files/ruby/reconcile_staff.rb <./files/ruby/reconcile_staff.rb>`__ grants the admin flag to the members of the ``administrator`` role group and the moderator flag to the members of the ``moderator`` role group, and revokes both from every other account, as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer. The platform administrator keeps the admin flag."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Stalwart mail server.** The new *web-app-stalwart* role runs SMTP, submission, IMAP, POP3, JMAP, ManageSieve, CalDAV, CardDAV and WebDAV in one server, with spam filtering, DKIM and DMARC signing and a web admin interface, plus Roundcube webmail and a ClamAV scan of incoming mail. Domains, accounts, TLS, Keycloak sign-in, DKIM keys and DNS records are provisioned through Stalwart's management API on every deploy, in compose and in swarm mode. Two silent failures are closed: a Keycloak that was still starting could leave Stalwart without single sign-on for the life of the process, and the server wrote no logs at all. Both are fixed. See [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Stalwart replaces Mailu as the default mail provider.** *MAIL_PROVIDER* now defaults to *web-app-stalwart*, and every application switches its mail settings on only while the configured provider is deployed. An inventory that keeps Mailu must set *MAIL_PROVIDER: web-app-mailu*, otherwise its applications stop sending mail. Mailu is now *deprecated*: it keeps working until it is removed, but new deployments must not adopt it, and CI no longer deploys or tests it, the mailbox import included. To move over, deploy Stalwart next to Mailu and switch on *services.stalwart.migration.import_mailu*: in compose mode the role imports every inventory account's mail from Mailu over IMAP, keeping folders, flags and dates, and re-runs skip what is already there. See [web-app-stalwart](roles/web-app-stalwart/README.md)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Standardized container execution** by fully replacing raw Docker CLI usage with the *container* and *compose* wrappers, enforcing engine-agnostic behavior via integration tests"
msgstr "**मानकीकृत कंटेनर निष्पादन** पूरी तरह से कच्चे डोकर सीएलआई के उपयोग को बदलकर *कंटेनर* और *रचना* रैपर, एकीकरण परीक्षणों के माध्यम से इंजन-एग्नोस्टिक व्यवहार को लागू करना"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Standards Support:** Seamlessly integrate with SAML, OpenID Connect, and OAuth2 to support various authentication flows."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static Content Hosting:** Serve any type of static files (documents, software, media, etc.)."
msgstr "**स्थैतिक सामग्री होस्टिंग:** किसी भी प्रकार की स्थैतिक फ़ाइलों की सेवा करें (दस्तावेज़, सॉफ्टवेयर, मीडिया आदि)।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static IP:** Exposes a fixed resolver address on its own network for ``dns:`` targeting."
msgstr "**स्टेटिक आईपी:** अपने स्वयं के नेटवर्क पर एक निश्चित समाधानकर्ता पते को उजागर करता है ``dns:`` लक्ष्यीकरण"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static IP:** Exposes a fixed resolver address on its own network for `dns:` targeting."
msgstr "**स्टेटिक आईपी:** अपने स्वयं के नेटवर्क पर एक निश्चित समाधानकर्ता पते को उजागर करता है `dns:` लक्ष्यीकरण"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Static Site Hosting:** Serves HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and other static files."
msgstr "**स्थैतिक साइट होस्टिंग:** HTML, CSS, जावास्क्रिप्ट और अन्य स्थैतिक फ़ाइलों को सर्व करता है।"

msgid "**Status Document:** Writes after every sweep the state of each dashboard application (``running``, ``paused``, ``degraded``, ``down``, its worst domain counts) and the check time to ``lookup('nginx', 'files.health_status')``, which the dashboard serves as ``/status.json``; applications without a dashboard card and the HTTP codes stay out of it, because the document is public."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Status Document:** Writes after every sweep the state of each dashboard application (`running`, `paused`, `degraded`, `down`, its worst domain counts) and the check time to `lookup('nginx', 'files.health_status')`, which the dashboard serves as `/status.json`; applications without a dashboard card and the HTTP codes stay out of it, because the document is public."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Status codes / health.** An authenticated MCP endpoint returns a non-2xx status (e.g. `401`/`406`) to unauthenticated probes. The role MUST NOT let the MCP path break the platform uptime/status-code check: either the health probe targets an unauthenticated `mcp.endpoint.health_path`, or the MCP path is excluded from the canonical `status_codes` check. The chosen approach MUST be explicit in `server.yml`."
msgstr "**स्थिति कोड / स्वास्थ्य।** एक प्रमाणित MCP समापन बिंदु एक गैर रिटर्न2xx स्थिति (उदाहरण `401`/`406`) अनधिकृत जांच करने के लिए। भूमिका MUST ने MCP पथ को मंच अपटाइम / स्टेटस-कोड चेक को तोड़ने की अनुमति नहीं दी: या तो स्वास्थ्य जांच एक unauthenticated लक्ष्य `mcp.endpoint.health_path`, या MCP पथ canonical से बाहर रखा गया है `status_codes` जाँच करें। चयनित दृष्टिकोण MUST में स्पष्ट होना चाहिए `server.yml`।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Status:** accepted"
msgstr "**स्थिति:** स्वीकार करना"

msgid "**Stop and start templates:** The `Infinito.Nexus` project holds `stop <application_id>` and `start <application_id>` for every application the host registered with `control: true`, plus `stop all` and `start all` over exactly that set. The deploy converges the project, its SSH key, inventory, repository, environment and templates idempotently through a short-lived API token, and removes the templates of applications the host no longer holds."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Stop and start templates:** The ``Infinito.Nexus`` project holds ``stop <application_id>`` and ``start <application_id>`` for every application the host registered with ``control: true``, plus ``stop all`` and ``start all`` over exactly that set. The deploy converges the project, its SSH key, inventory, repository, environment and templates idempotently through a short-lived API token, and removes the templates of applications the host no longer holds."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Storage backend is `raft`** (integrated storage), single node, on one persistent volume."
msgstr "**भंडारण बैकेंड है `raft`** (एकीकृत भंडारण), एकल नोड, एक लगातार मात्रा पर।"

msgid "**Storage follows the object store.** Loki stores its chunks in S3 through the shared object-store lookup when the object store is deployed (decided by `group_names`, like every other object-store consumer), and on a node-local volume with `placement: manager` and `nfs: false` otherwise. Log chunks are not backed up; the Grafana database declares `backup.stop_required: true`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Storage follows the object store:** with ``web-svc-seaweedfs`` in ``group_names``, Loki stores chunks and index in the bucket the ``objstore`` lookup provisions; otherwise on the node-local volume ``loki_data`` (``nfs: false``) of the manager. Chunks declare ``backup: false``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Storage follows the object store:** with `web-svc-seaweedfs` in `group_names`, Loki stores chunks and index in the bucket the `objstore` lookup provisions; otherwise on the node-local volume `loki_data` (`nfs: false`) of the manager. Chunks declare `backup: false`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Stored app-password does not decrypt:** `BLUESKY_BRIDGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY` changed since the entry in `BROKER_STORE_PATH` was written. The broker resets the password of the stored DID through the PDS admin API (`PDS_ADMIN_PASSWORD`), stores it encrypted with the current key and completes the handoff. Account, handle and posts stay."
msgstr ""

