msgid "**V1 (SSO):** The oauth2-proxy edge gate redirects all requests to Keycloak and admits only members of the ``web-app-n8n`` ``administrator`` and ``mcp`` groups. ``files/hooks.js`` reads the trusted ``Remote-Email`` header openresty sets once the gate passes and auto-provisions/logs in the matching n8n user (role ``global:member``, or the pre-existing owner for ``users.administrator.email``), so an admitted user lands directly on n8n’s own workflow surface with no second, n8n-local login step. To admit a user, add them to the ``administrator`` or ``mcp`` role group of ``web-app-n8n`` in Keycloak."
msgstr ""

