msgstr "**`.onion` सार्वजनिक प्रत्यय सूची में है** → `user@x.onion` सबसे अधिक मान्यकर्ता"

msgid "**`/dev/fuse`:** `pmxcfs` mounts the cluster file system at `/etc/pve` through FUSE; every Proxmox VE service reads its configuration there."
msgstr ""

msgid "**`/dev/kvm`:** QEMU starts the agent VMs with hardware virtualization; without it they would run emulated and too slowly to serve a task."
msgstr ""

msgid "**`/dev/net/tun`:** QEMU attaches each VM network card as a tap device on the VM bridge inside the container."
msgstr ""

msgid "**`/dev/vhost-net`:** the in-kernel virtio network backend for those tap devices, so VM traffic is not copied through QEMU."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`/etc/hosts` fallback**. used in non-systemd environments (e.g. Docker containers, LXC) where service management is unavailable; writes a managed block of host entries directly into the hosts file."
