msgid "A caller that includes the role with its own ``web_opt_rdr_domains_mappings`` renders only that list; without it the role renders ``CURRENT_PLAY_REDIRECT_DOMAINS``, which holds these redirects, the primary domain’s redirect to the homepage and every application alias."
