msgid "A cluster row states the cluster marker where a single-database row names a database, so :func:`credentials_of` would file every instance under the same key and keep only the first. Cluster credentials are therefore keyed by instance."
msgstr "एक क्लस्टर पंक्ति क्लस्टर मार्कर को बताती है जहां एक एकल-डाटाबेस पंक्ति डेटाबेस का नाम देती है, इसलिए :func:`credentials_of` प्रत्येक उदाहरण को एक ही कुंजी के तहत दायर करेगा और केवल पहले ही रहेगा। उदाहरण के लिए क्लस्टर क्रेडेंशियल की कुंजी है।"

msgid "A cluster whose `global/pg_control` became `pg_control.old` and no newer cluster"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A cold server answers its opening requests well above its steady rate, and the pair measured first used to inherit that and win every sweep. Repeating a pair back to back does not help, because all of its runs then sit inside the same opening window. The grid is therefore walked once per pass and the passes are what repeat, so the bonus lands on one run of one pair and the median drops it. The recorded spread says whether the winner is a real difference or the noise the whole grid sits in."
msgstr "एक ठंडा सर्वर अपने शुरुआती अनुरोधों को अपनी स्थिर दर के ऊपर अच्छी तरह से जवाब देता है, और जोड़ी ने पहले इसे विरासत में लाने और हर स्वीप जीतने के लिए इस्तेमाल किया। एक जोड़ी को वापस वापस करने में मदद नहीं करता है क्योंकि इसके सभी रन एक ही उद्घाटन विंडो के अंदर बैठते हैं। इसलिए ग्रिड प्रति पास एक बार चली जाती है और पास क्या दोहरा होता है, इसलिए बोनस एक जोड़ी के एक रन पर उतरता है और माध्य इसे छोड़ देता है। रिकॉर्ड किए गए स्प्रेड का कहना है कि विजेता एक वास्तविक अंतर है या पूरे ग्रिड में स्थित शोर है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A colon suffix on `<source>` is classified by shape:"
msgstr "पर एक उपनिवेश `<source>` आकार द्वारा वर्गीकृत किया गया है:"

msgid "A comparison is invalid across a changed image state, a one-time cost, a shared-cache re-render outlier, a wait that hides a failure, or a machine another gate, deploy or translation shared; one full suite runs at a time and the log is persisted outside `/tmp` before measuring."
msgstr ""

msgid "A comparison is invalid when the two runs differ in image state, when one pays a one-time cost (a first-run purge, a migration), when a SPOT re-render shows up as a single carry outlier, when a wait hides a failure (count `FAILED - RETRYING`; a long wait may be a ban, not slowness), or when another gate, deploy or translation shared the machine. Run one full suite at a time and persist logs outside `/tmp` before measuring."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A complete digital learning environment for schools, academies, and universities."
msgstr "स्कूलों, शिक्षाओं और विश्वविद्यालयों के लिए एक पूर्ण डिजिटल सीखने का माहौल।"

msgid "A compose deploy reads ``schema_migrations`` of an existing database before the pinned image starts. The newest aggregated migration ``1000NNN`` marks a schema migrated by major NNN + 1; without one, ``20241015081341`` marks 15 and anything older counts as 14. For every major between that stage and the pinned ``services.web.version``, the deploy stops the old app containers, runs the seeder of ``openproject/openproject:<major>`` and works off the queued GoodJob jobs with `drain_jobs.rb <./files/ruby/drain_jobs.rb>`__, then starts the pinned major. A database migrated by a newer major than the pinned one stops the deploy. Swarm deploys skip the stepping, so the pinned seeder reports an incompatible schema itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "A compose deploy reads `schema_migrations` of an existing database before the pinned image starts. The newest aggregated migration `1000NNN` marks a schema migrated by major NNN + 1; without one, `20241015081341` marks 15 and anything older counts as 14. For every major between that stage and the pinned `services.web.version`, the deploy stops the old app containers, runs the seeder of `openproject/openproject:<major>` and works off the queued GoodJob jobs with [drain_jobs.rb](./files/ruby/drain_jobs.rb), then starts the pinned major. A database migrated by a newer major than the pinned one stops the deploy. Swarm deploys skip the stepping, so the pinned seeder reports an incompatible schema itself."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A computed fallback defined in `_compute(short_key, resolved, variables)`."
msgstr "में परिभाषित एक गणनात्मक गिरावट `_compute(short_key, resolved, variables)`।"

