msgstr "A doc `README.md` MUST उस निर्देशिका में दर्शकों, विषय क्षेत्र, या दस्तावेज़ीकरण की सीमा का वर्णन करता है जब वह संदर्भ पाठकों को मदद करता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST explain what kind of documentation lives in that directory and what scope that documentation covers. It MUST help readers understand the subject area and boundary of the folder without replacing the documentation pages themselves."
msgstr "A doc `README.md` MUST बताता है कि किस तरह के प्रलेखन उस निर्देशिका में रहते हैं और कौन से गुंजाइश दस्तावेज़ीकरण कवर करता है। यह MUST मदद पाठकों को अपने दस्तावेज़ीकरण पृष्ठों को बदलने के बिना विषय क्षेत्र और फ़ोल्डर की सीमा को समझने में मदद करता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST stay short and scope-focused."
msgstr "A doc `README.md` MUST छोटी और गुंजाइश-केंद्रित रहता है।"

msgid "A double-click on a locked field opens a confirmation dialog; after confirming, the field is editable. The next run still writes the inventory value and reports the drift."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dropped tag is built again the next time someone opens it. To rebuild a version that is still on disk, delete ``sites/<version>`` inside the ``docs_sites`` volume; its next visit builds it again from ``prepared/<version>.*``, so delete that tree too to regenerate its sources."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dropped tag is built again the next time someone opens it. To rebuild a version that is still on disk, delete `sites/<version>` inside the `docs_sites` volume; its next visit builds it again from `prepared/<version>.*`, so delete that tree too to regenerate its sources."
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed ``final`` swaps nothing: Stalwart 0.16 serves the database ``stalwart`` again, and ``stalwart_v1`` and ``migrate-v016/state`` hold the unfinished copy. ``stalwart-migrate rollback`` does not apply, it copies a 1.x store back into a new 0.16 store. Every deploy of this role runs ``all`` again while the store is 0.16, so keep the role out of deploys until the rows are understood."
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed `final` swaps nothing: Stalwart 0.16 serves the database `stalwart` again, and `stalwart_v1` and `migrate-v016/state` hold the unfinished copy. `stalwart-migrate rollback` does not apply, it copies a 1.x store back into a new 0.16 store. Every deploy of this role runs `all` again while the store is 0.16, so keep the role out of deploys until the rows are understood."
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed final run"
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed log write aborts the routine and stops its child processes."
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed mutation leaves the repository `rev` unstored, so the next cycle plans the repository again. Mappings already written stay, so nothing is created twice. A mirrored event deleted by hand in Mobilizon is recreated on the next update of its record and forgotten on the next delete."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A failing pre-state snapshot aborts the deploy (no `suppress_flush`): no update proceeds without a successful backup of the state it is about to change. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` is never started at deploy time (no device present); it stays plug-triggered via its `.mount` unit."
msgstr "एक असफल प्री-स्टेट स्नैपशॉट तैनात करने की घोषणा करता है (नहीं `suppress_flush`): राज्य के सफल बैकअप के बिना कोई अद्यतन आय नहीं है, यह परिवर्तन के बारे में है। `svc-bkp-local-2-device` कभी कभी नहीं शुरू होता है (कोई उपकरण मौजूद नहीं)यह अपने माध्यम से प्लग-ट्रिगर्ड रहता है `.mount` इकाई"

msgid "A failure classified as deterministic is not retried; a flaky one is retried once."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback MUST stay inside the permitted set, and a run whose whole permitted set is unservable MUST fail rather than leave it. The job title and the artifact name carry the kind the matrix assigned; the step summary carries the effective one."
msgstr "अनुमति सेट के अंदर एक फ्लेमबैक MUST रहता है, और एक ऐसा रन जिसके पूरे अनुमत सेट को छोड़ देने के बजाय असहाय नहीं है। नौकरी का शीर्षक और कलाकृति का नाम जिस तरह से निर्दिष्ट मैट्रिक्स ले जाता है; चरण सारांश प्रभावी होता है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback is reported, never silent. The job title and artifact name carry the kind the matrix *assigned*, while [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) writes the *effective* filesystem and the reason into the step summary. When a run has to prove a filesystem-dependent path, read the summary rather than the title, or name the kind on the run to make it a demand. The snapshot mode of `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is the case that matters: it only engages on btrfs and zfs."
msgstr "एक गिरावट की सूचना कभी चुप नहीं है। नौकरी का शीर्षक और कलाकृति नाम जिस तरह मैट्रिक्स ले *नियुक्त*जबकि [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) लिखना *प्रभावी* फ़ाइल सिस्टम और चरण सारांश में कारण। जब एक रन को एक फ़ाइलसिस्टम-निर्भर पथ साबित करना पड़ता है, तो शीर्षक के बजाय सारांश को पढ़ें, या उस तरह के नाम को चलाने के लिए इसे एक मांग बनाने के लिए। का स्नैपशॉट मोड `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` यह मामला है कि मामले: यह केवल btrfs और zfs पर संलग्न है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A federated and community-driven platform for discussion, media sharing, and social networking."
msgstr "चर्चा, मीडिया साझा करने और सामाजिक नेटवर्किंग के लिए एक संघीय और सामुदायिक संचालित मंच।"

msgid "A field overwritten by a timer or a deploy counts as overwritten, the same as one overwritten at login."
msgstr ""

msgid "A file is either a role's own (it changes that role), a test (it runs in T0), a plugin (it changes whoever calls it by name), a group_vars file (it changes whoever reads one of its keys), a module others import, deploy machinery or a global deploy file (it changes every deploy), CI or developer tooling no deploy runs, or unknown. The tooling list is closed on purpose: a script directory nobody listed counts as deploy machinery, so a new one widens the plan instead of silently narrowing it. ``agents/`` is not tooling: the agent roles read its YAML through the ``agent_config`` lookup at deploy time."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A filesystem row states the kind the matrix *assigned*. A deploy may fall back from it when the host kernel cannot serve it (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) and the title does not record that, so read that axis as a preference ranking and prove the kind separately before pinning it."
msgstr "एक फ़ाइलसिस्टम पंक्ति मैट्रिक्स की तरह बताती है *नियुक्त*जब मेजबान कर्नेल इसकी सेवा नहीं कर सकता तो एक तैनाती इससे वापस आ सकती है। (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) और शीर्षक यह रिकॉर्ड नहीं करता है, इसलिए उस अक्ष को वरीयता रैंकिंग के रूप में पढ़ें और इसे पिन करने से पहले अलग तरह साबित करें।."

msgid "A filter file registers the keys of the literal dict its ``FilterModule.filters`` returns; a lookup or action file registers its stem when it defines the plugin class; a module registers its stem. A file without the plugin class is a helper and registers nothing."
msgstr ""

msgid "A fix for a difference between environments declares a capability, a run fact such as `INFINITO_GHCR_MIRROR` or `INFINITO_CACHE_STACK`, and never checks the runtime identity (`runs_on_github`, `RUNTIME`); lint L18 flags such a check. A test that decides on the environment clears every capability variable it does not set."
msgstr ""

msgid "A fixture CVE feed naming one of the bundle's pinned images is the security role's scenario source, so its CVE path is exercised without reaching a live advisory service."
msgstr ""

msgid "A fixture tree with seeded legal findings is the counsel's repository target: a dependency whose licence the project licence cannot absorb, a vendored file without a licence, an Apache-2.0 dependency without its NOTICE, a build-only dependency under a copyleft licence that is never distributed, and a third-party logo used beyond plain reference."
msgstr ""

msgid "A flag is ``true`` when the addon is ``enabled`` and, where it declares ``bridges``, at least one bridged partner is deployed in this round. ``required`` does not enter the gate: it says whether a failed install aborts the play, not whether the addon runs, and ANDing it here made the spec of every optional addon unreachable in every variant, because no variant pins ``required`` while variants do pin addon ``enabled``."
msgstr ""

msgid "A flaky spec is fixed or reported, never hidden behind retries."
msgstr ""

msgid "A foreign container binds a declared port, two containers bind the same port"
msgstr ""

msgid "A foreign docker network overlaps a declared subnet"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fork PR triggers a `pull_request_target` run that builds and mirrors any new images needed by the fork, authenticating to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN`."
msgstr "एक कांटा PR ट्रिगर करता है `pull_request_target` रन जो कि फोर्क द्वारा आवश्यक किसी भी नई छवियां बनाता है और दर्पण करता है, जो प्रति-जॉब के साथ जीएचसीआर को प्रमाणित करता है `GITHUB_TOKEN`।"

msgid "A forward keeps the message in the account and sends a copy to every destination. The role writes the Sieve script ``infinito-forward`` (``redirect :copy``) into the account and activates it; a user script that was active is chained through ``include``, so personal filters keep working. Removing a forward from the inventory leaves the script in place; delete ``infinito-forward`` in the account’s filter settings to stop it. The role raises the user-script limits ``maxRedirects`` and ``maxOutMessages`` to the widest forward and reloads the settings; under SSO the restart of ```tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`` <tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml>`__ applies them instead, because a reload opens the OIDC issuer and Keycloak deploys after Stalwart."
msgstr ""

msgid "A forward keeps the message in the account and sends a copy to every destination. The role writes the Sieve script `infinito-forward` (`redirect :copy`) into the account and activates it; a user script that was active is chained through `include`, so personal filters keep working. Removing a forward from the inventory leaves the script in place; delete `infinito-forward` in the account's filter settings to stop it. The role raises the user-script limits `maxRedirects` and `maxOutMessages` to the widest forward and reloads the settings; under SSO the restart of [`tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`](tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml) applies them instead, because a reload opens the OIDC issuer and Keycloak deploys after Stalwart."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fourth variant was built first and then withdrawn: `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_limit.py` caps a role at three, on the stated ground that variants exercise dynamic-flag polarities rather than enumerate features, and the `# nocheck: variant-limit` escape would have been a suppression bought to keep a design that fits in three anyway."
msgstr "एक चौथा संस्करण पहले बनाया गया था और फिर वापस ले लिया गया: `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_limit.py` तीन पर एक भूमिका टोपियां, जिसमें कहा गया है कि वेरिएंट सुविधाओं को बढ़ाने के बजाय गतिशील-फ्लैग ध्रुवीयता का प्रयोग करते हैं, और सुविधाओं को बढ़ाने के बजाय गतिशील-फ्लैग ध्रुवीयता का प्रयोग करते हैं। `# nocheck: variant-limit` भागने के लिए एक दमन खरीदा गया था जो किसी भी तरह से तीन में फिट बैठता है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fragment can only ever be stricter than the host already is. In nftables an ``accept`` terminates its own base chain and nothing more: the packet still traverses every other chain at that hook, and a ``drop`` in any of them wins. A rule that has to overrule a policy someone else set, such as the ``DROP`` docker installs on forwarded packets, does not belong in a fragment at all; it belongs in the chain that carries that policy."
msgstr "पहले से ही मेजबान की तुलना में एक टुकड़ा हमेशा सख्त हो सकता है। nftables में ``accept`` अपनी खुद की बेस श्रृंखला को समाप्त कर देता है और कुछ भी नहीं: पैकेट अभी भी उस हुक पर हर दूसरी श्रृंखला को पीछे छोड़ देता है, और एक ``drop`` उनमें से किसी भी जीत में। एक नियम जिसे किसी अन्य व्यक्ति द्वारा निर्धारित पॉलिसी को ओवरराइड करना पड़ता है, जैसे कि किसी अन्य व्यक्ति, जैसे कि ``DROP`` डकर ने आगे के पैकेट पर स्थापित किया है, सभी पर एक खंड से संबंधित नहीं है; यह उस श्रृंखला में है जो उस नीति को वहन करती है।"

