msgid "A host may be a spoke of several meshes: it routes the pool through its first declared one and only the mesh subnet through the others, so no two interfaces claim one route."
msgstr ""

msgid "A host overrides one role in the inventory at `applications.<role>.services.<entity>.debug.enabled`, which wins over `meta/services.yml`. An override for a switch whose lookup the role never calls is dead config and fails the lint. [test_role_mode_switches.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/variables/test_role_mode_switches.py) enforces the rule, and the lookups live in [debug.py](../../../../../plugins/lookup/debug.py) and [validate.py](../../../../../plugins/lookup/validate.py)."
