msgid "Ansible output is read as the repository's callback writes it: ANSI colour codes, an act ``[workflow/job]   | `` prefix under act, a ``TASK [...]`` banner per task, an ``[ERROR]: Task failed:`` cause line before the ``fatal: [host]: FAILED! =>`` line, and the result as a YAML body after it. A task that ends with ``...ignoring`` failed without stopping the run, and a ``FAILED - RETRYING`` line is a retry the task may still pass. A run that ended red (a ``PLAY RECAP`` with a failed or unreachable host; without a recap, a non-zero exit line) is decided by its last fatal, even when ``always:`` tasks or handlers ran after it; otherwise a fatal that a later ``TASK`` banner follows was rescued, and only the failures after the last banner decide."
