msgid "Before it changes anything the replay claims the target with `mkdir /var/lib/infinito-target-claim` over SSH. One target serves one replay per reset, so replays run one after another; a second one on the same target, or a target that refuses the key, fails the test with a pointer to `make compose-target-reset`."
