msgstr "प्रत्येक परिनियोजित मोड में भूमिका की प्राथमिक इकाई टॉगल हो सकती है। ``compose``/``swarm`` लक्ष्य स्टैक भूमिका (स्वयं के कंटेनर स्टैक); ``host`` एक स्टैक शिपिंग के बजाय होस्ट को कॉन्फ़िगर करने वाली अक्षम भूमिकाओं को लक्षित करता है।"

msgid "Every deploy port a host process outside docker already listens on."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy reads `$OC_Version` from `version.php` in the `nextcloud_data` volume and compares its major with the pinned `services.nextcloud.version`, which MUST start with the major number (`34-fpm-alpine`, `32.0.3-fpm-alpine`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy reads ``$OC_Version`` from ``version.php`` in the ``nextcloud_data`` volume and compares its major with the pinned ``services.nextcloud.version``, which MUST start with the major number (``34-fpm-alpine``, ``32.0.3-fpm-alpine``)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy stamps `emailVerified=true` on every inventory user whatever address the user holds, and with LDAP on the address reset is skipped, so app-side `email_verified` checks are hollow for inventory users (roles/web-app-keycloak/files/python/email_verified.py:46-53, roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/03_manager_ops/update_routines.yml:31-33,49-51, read). Hotfix in progress on fix/iam/email-takeover-hotfix."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy verifies the resulting credentials through `/api/auth/login` and the authenticated `/api/auth/me`, then removes the temporary session. Rejected logins fail the deploy even if the container is healthy. Credentials travel on standard input to an unconditionally masked task; only a fixed success/failure message is shown. Reconciliation runs in a separate Node process, so it opens the running database through the image's internal `db/index.js` `connectDb` export before using the auth service exports; both must be checked when changing the image version. Under **Keys**, copy the unified API key for clients. Model availability depends on your configured providers and their quotas; deploying this role does not supply provider accounts or bypass their limits."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy verifies the resulting credentials through ``/api/auth/login`` and the authenticated ``/api/auth/me``, then removes the temporary session. Rejected logins fail the deploy even if the container is healthy. Credentials travel on standard input to an unconditionally masked task; only a fixed success/failure message is shown. Reconciliation runs in a separate Node process, so it opens the running database through the image’s internal ``db/index.js`` ``connectDb`` export before using the auth service exports; both must be checked when changing the image version. Under **Keys**, copy the unified API key for clients. Model availability depends on your configured providers and their quotas; deploying this role does not supply provider accounts or bypass their limits."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every desk list page logs one `Executing inline event handler violates the following Content Security Policy directive 'script-src-attr 'self''` per page menu entry (measured: 17 `a.grey-link[onclick]` on `/desk/build/todo`, 16 on `/desk/users/user`, 49 console errors after two list pages). Cause: Frappe renders the page menu entries with `onClick=\"return false;\"` (`frappe/public/js/frappe/ui/page.js:564,577` at v16.50.0) and `meta/csp.yml` allows no inline handler, so a click on such an entry also follows its `href=\"#\"`. Options: allow that one handler through `'unsafe-hashes'` plus its hash in `script-src-attr`, or accept the blocked handler since the menu actions run through jQuery handlers."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every discovered endpoint authenticates through a header. A provider that keys its session by URL segment instead cannot scope that segment per consumer or revoke it, so it is fronted by an adapter and the segment stays between the adapter and its upstream."
msgstr "प्रत्येक खोजे गए समापन बिंदु को एक हेडर के माध्यम से प्रमाणित करता है। एक प्रदाता जो URL सेगमेंट द्वारा अपने सत्र की कुंजी करता है, वह उस सेगमेंट को उपभोक्ता के प्रति खोखला नहीं सकता है या इसे रद्द कर सकता है, इसलिए यह एक एडाप्टर द्वारा सामने आता है और खंड एडाप्टर और इसके अपस्ट्रीम के बीच रहता है।"

msgid "Every document is fetched once per run, so the pins that read the same release manifest resolve against one snapshot of it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every domain the network registry places on the clearnet, lower-cased, without a trailing dot, sorted and without duplicates."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every embodiable agent runs the admission checks"
msgstr "प्रत्येक अवतार लेने योग्य एजेंट प्रवेश जांच चलाता है"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every emoji used as a STRUCTURED marker across the project (complexity-matrix columns, lifecycle stages, deploy modes, boolean/state cells) is defined here exactly once, so a glyph means the same thing everywhere it appears. Emojis are unique: the module fails to import if two words share a glyph."
msgstr "हर इमोजी परियोजना भर में एक STRUCTURED मार्कर के रूप में इस्तेमाल किया (जटिलता-मैट्रिक्स कॉलम, जीवनचक्र चरण, परिनियोजित मोड, बोओलेन / स्टेट सेल) यहाँ बिल्कुल एक बार परिभाषित किया गया है, इसलिए ग्लिफ़ का मतलब है कि हर जगह यह दिखाई देता है। इमोजी अद्वितीय हैं: मॉड्यूल आयात करने में विफल रहता है यदि दो शब्द एक ग्लाइफ साझा करते हैं।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every env variable the spec reads MUST be exposed in the role's `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Names MUST match exactly."
msgstr "प्रत्येक env चर कल्पना पढ़ने MUST भूमिका में उजागर किया जा सकता है `templates/playwright.env.j2`. MUST बिल्कुल मैच नाम।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every external CI trigger MUST route through one of the entry workflows. Each entry translates its event into a call to the orchestrator; the catalog of triggers and inputs lives in [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "प्रत्येक बाहरी CI प्रवेश कार्यप्रवाह में से एक के माध्यम से MUST मार्ग को ट्रिगर करता है। प्रत्येक प्रविष्टि अपनी घटना को ऑर्केस्ट्रेटर को कॉल में बदल देती है; ट्रिगर और इनपुट की सूची में रहता है [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every external test directory MUST contain `__init__.py` so repository-wide test structure checks keep passing."
msgstr "प्रत्येक बाहरी परीक्षण निर्देशिका MUST में शामिल हैं `__init__.py` इसलिए भंडारी-व्यापी परीक्षण संरचना जांच गुजरते रहते हैं।"

msgid "Every fact comes from the module the deploy itself uses, so the plan cannot drift from it: the closure from ``cli.meta.roles.applications.resolution .affected`` (the resolver ``affected_roles.sh`` calls), the rows from the complexity model the matrix planner reads, the include set from ``cli.meta.ci.host_rows.swarm_closure``, the storage from ``utils.storage.constrained`` and the free space from ``cli.meta.ci.swarm_preflight.free_space``."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every failed check and every failed scan run sends an email to the security contact from the inventory; the email carries only the severity and a link to the work package, never details of the finding."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every failure is fixed at its root. A lint hit is resolved by deleting the offending construct, not by a `nocheck` marker, a loosened rule, or a target dropped from the gate — any suppression needs the operator's explicit approval and a stated reason."
msgstr "हर असफलता अपनी जड़ पर तय हो जाती है। एक लिंट हिट को बंद निर्माण को हटाने के द्वारा हल किया जाता है, न कि एक द्वारा `nocheck` मार्कर, एक ढीला नियम, या एक लक्ष्य गेट से गिरा — किसी भी दमन ऑपरेटर की स्पष्ट स्वीकृति और एक निश्चित कारण की जरूरत है।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every failure raises AnsibleError with an actionable message."
msgstr "हर असफलता एक कार्रवाई योग्य संदेश के साथ AnsibleError बढ़ जाती है।"

msgid "Every field an application role converges from the inventory, at deploy, at container start, at login or by a timer, is a managed field. The SSO profile fields below are one group of them; the application settings in [Settings field inventory](#settings-field-inventory-2026-11-04) are the other."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every field declares its `mode`; there is no default. `mode: enforced` writes the field on every run and locks it in the application; `mode: seeded` writes it once, at install or while it is empty, and leaves it editable without any marker."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every field of `agent.yml` and every entry of `cron.yml` has a default and is overridable from the inventory under `agents.<role>`, except `agents.hacker.targets`, which has no default and must be set before the hacker runs. `agents.counsel.targets` defaults to an empty list, which skips the counsel's instance checks and names them as skipped in its report. `write_enabled` defaults to `false`, `keepass.mode` to `broker`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every field of `agent.yml` and every entry of `cron.yml` is overridable from the inventory under `agents.<role>`, deep-merged over the role's files. Every consumer reads the merged result through `lookup('agent_config', role, path)`, never the raw files."
msgstr ""

# है `meta/addons/` साथ `mechanism: mu_plugin` और `source: vendored`, और addon
# id फ़ाइल स्टेम है। [04mu plugins.yml](../../tasks/04_mu_plugins.yml) उन
# घोषणाओं और प्रतियों पर लूप `<addon_id>.php` प्रत्येक तैनाती पर कंटेनर में;
# एक नई फ़ाइल इसलिए इसकी आवश्यकता है `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` इससे पहले कि
# यह स्थापित किया गया है, प्रवेश और एक Playwright कल्पना।.
# gained=['plugins.yml']
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every file here is declared as an addon under `meta/addons/` with `mechanism: mu_plugin` and `source: vendored`, and the addon id is the file stem. [04_mu_plugins.yml](../../tasks/04_mu_plugins.yml) loops over those declarations and copies `<addon_id>.php` into the container on every deploy; a new file therefore needs its `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` entry and a Playwright spec before it is installed."
msgstr "यहां प्रत्येक फ़ाइल को ऐडऑन के रूप में घोषित किया जाता है `meta/addons/` साथ `mechanism: mu_plugin` और `source: vendored`, और addon id फ़ाइल स्टेम है। [04mu plugins.yml](../../tasks/04_mu_plugins.yml) उन घोषणाओं और प्रतियों पर लूप `<addon_id>.php` प्रत्येक तैनाती पर कंटेनर में; एक नई फ़ाइल इसलिए इसकी आवश्यकता है `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` इससे पहले कि यह स्थापित किया गया है, प्रवेश और एक Playwright कल्पना।."

msgid "Every finding becomes a work package in the confidential legal project with severity (blocker, finding, note), check, location, licence or law, proposed fix and evidence (`proven` or `derived`); a finding that an earlier run already filed updates its work package instead of opening a new one."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every finding becomes a work package in the confidential security project with severity, affected role, reproduction steps and evidence, never with live secrets."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every fresh load of `/admin` by a signed-in administrator is redirected to `#/sw/first/run/wizard/index/` (measured on the compose stack: the dashboard URL ends on the wizard route until a hash navigation leaves it), because `files/shell/init.sh` installs with `--basic-setup` and never completes the first-run wizard. Options: add `--skip-first-run-wizard` to `system:install` for new installations, or set `core.frw.completedAt` through `bin/console system:config:set` for existing ones."
