msgid "Every held job with its age in seconds, and every stack no running or held job owns."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every host a node-local path must exist on before a container binds it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every host-name entry becomes a dnsmasq rule unless the rule above it already gives the same path. dnsmasq picks the longest matching domain, and the entries covering any name are exactly the entries covering its deepest covering entry, so deciding each entry once decides every name below it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every id is installed by the one ``package_install`` run the constructor starts each deploy with, for every role that deploy may run. ``batch: false`` on the id, next to its distro keys, takes it out of that run; the role's own ``package_install`` task then installs it, which is required when the install is conditional or must wait for a setup step::"
msgstr ""

msgid "Every image is built from the pinned upstream clone. The image published on GHCR serves only the frontend and proxies `/api/*` to `api.worldmonitor.app`, so it cannot run self-contained; building the API, relay, REST bridge and seeders from the same tag keeps all traffic inside the stack."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every image is built from the pinned upstream clone. The image published on GHCR serves only the frontend and proxies ``/api/*`` to ``api.worldmonitor.app``, so it cannot run self-contained; building the API, relay, REST bridge and seeders from the same tag keeps all traffic inside the stack."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every image with tag, ID, age and size"
msgstr ""

