msgid "Every integration this repository declares between two of its own roles. A role names its provider as a key in ``meta/services.yml``, and an add-on under ``meta/addons/`` names the same key in its ``bridges:`` list. Both sides are read from the roles on each build, so this page cannot fall behind them."
