msgstr "एक शाब्दिक के साथ हर भूमिका `application_id` वास्तव में नीचे एक बार दर्ज किया गया है। इन सूचियों से लापता भूमिका के रूप में पढ़ा जाएगा \"अभी तक नहीं देखा\" और जैसा \"के खिलाफ फैसला\" एक ही समय में, दोनों को बताने के लिए कुछ भी नहीं है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an ``application_id`` declares exactly one ``mcp:`` entry. The block is an audit disposition first and a deployable surface second: ``classification`` states what the role is, and only a deployable classification may also carry ``enabled``/``shared`` and a served contract."
msgstr "प्रत्येक भूमिका के साथ ``application_id`` वास्तव में एक घोषित ``mcp:`` प्रवेश ब्लॉक पहली बार एक लेखा परीक्षा है और एक तैनात सतह दूसरा है: ``classification`` यह बताता है कि भूमिका क्या है, और केवल एक तैनाती योग्य वर्गीकरण भी ले सकता है ``enabled``/``shared`` और एक सेवा अनुबंध।"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an `application_id` carries one role-local `mcp:` mapping in `meta/services.yml`. Discovery selects only a deployable classification with explicit `enabled: true` and `shared: true`; an audit-only mapping never becomes an endpoint:"
msgstr "प्रत्येक भूमिका के साथ `application_id` एक भूमिका-स्थानीय `mcp:` मानचित्रण `meta/services.yml`. डिस्कवरी स्पष्टता के साथ केवल एक तैनाती योग्य वर्गीकरण का चयन करती है `enabled: true` और `shared: true`; एक लेखा परीक्षा-केवल मैपिंग कभी भी एक समापन बिंदु बन जाता है:"

msgid "Every role-scoped updater (`docker`, `source`, `pip`, `repository`) and the addon check skip a role whose [lifecycle](../../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md) is `eol`: no update PR is opened for it and no external test warns about its pins."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every routine iteration names its evidence source (a job log, an artifact, a probe, an oracle result) and records what it read. An iteration without new evidence is idle, not finished, while the observed source can still produce evidence (a CI run not completed, a deploy running, a queue not empty); the routine then waits through `make ci-wait`. The loop ends only when the source has completed and the last iteration found nothing new."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every row carries a footprint (the declared `min_storage` against the free space and its floor) and a cost. The output names the cost source: the declared storage, or the measured seconds of the deploy log or role-runtimes CSV passed as `timings=`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every row is assigned its deploy mode, network mode, distro, filesystem and CPU architecture by its position in that list (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every row of the CI matrix is one ``role#variant`` selection. Six axes are decided here, all as a deterministic rotation over the row's position in the *global* discovery order and the sweep number -- never at random, so a red job can be reproduced by re-running the same sweep, and so consecutive sweeps cover the combinations instead of sampling them:"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every rule in `permissions.ask` assumes the operator reads the prompt and confirms the action matches intent. Rules in `ask` are NOT a hard barrier. They are a speed-bump that converts automatic execution into a deliberate decision."
msgstr "प्रत्येक नियम में `permissions.ask` माना जाता है कि ऑपरेटर ने तुरंत पढ़ा और कार्रवाई मैचों की इरादे की पुष्टि की। नियम `ask` एक कठिन बाधा नहीं है। वे एक स्पीड-बंप हैं जो स्वचालित निष्पादन को एक जानबूझकर निर्णय में बदल देता है।"

msgid "Every rule marked ✅ in this document is **actively enforced** on the default branch (`main`)."
