msgid "Every rule of this requirement that can be checked without a running stack has a lint test under `tests/lint/agents/`. Each lint runs in `make test-lint`, runs alone through the lint target for one role or one file, and ships a fixture that turns it red. `agents/criteria.yml` points every lint-proven criterion to its lint id."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every run against a production target is `ask` and runs only after the owner approves that run."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every run writes logs, state, screenshots and galleries under its own run directory with a run index on persistent storage, never on tmpfs; no run overwrites another run's output."
