# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Files MUST use the pattern `NN_<topic>.yml`, where `NN` is a zero-padded two-digit numeric prefix. Ansible loads files in lexicographic order, so the prefix determines the load order and lets later files reference values defined earlier."
