# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For every marker entry declared anywhere in :data:`utils.roles.mapping.ROLE_FILES` the predicate reads the role's file at the entry's dotted path. Each marker that resolves to a non-empty string adds the surrounding type to the result."
msgstr "प्रत्येक मार्कर प्रविष्टि के लिए कहीं भी घोषित :data:`utils.roles.mapping.ROLE_FILES` भविष्यवाणी ने प्रवेश के बिंदु पर भूमिका की फ़ाइल को पढ़ा। प्रत्येक मार्कर जो एक गैर-खाली स्ट्रिंग को हल करता है, परिणाम के लिए आसपास के प्रकार को जोड़ता है।"

msgid "For every role under roles_dir whose meta/services.yml defines a service listed in `services`, set enabled: false and shared: false in host_vars_file under applications.<app_id>.services.<svc_name>.  Missing application or services blocks are created as needed. The same happens to every entry whose base `enabled` is the presence test of a disabled provider role (:func:`find_presence_dependents`), so a variant's literal pin cannot keep it on once that provider leaves the inventory."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
