# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "ताइगा रीडायरेक्ट `/` जनता के लिए `/discover` शोकेस, जो एक नंगे लॉगइन लिंक प्रदान करता है लेकिन ओआईडीसी प्रविष्टि बिंदु नहीं; केवल `/login` एसएसओ निर्देशन को बांधता है (में टिप्पणी देखें [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js))साझा व्यक्तित्व हमेशा साइट रूट में प्रवेश करते हैं, इसलिए वे कभी नहीं पहुंच सकते हैं TaigaSSO बटन ताइगा के कोणीयजेएस खोल अतिरिक्त रूप से केवल लोगोट को उजागर करता है `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` निर्देश, जो जेनेरिक इन-ऐप लोगोट सहायक सक्रिय नहीं कर सकते हैं। [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) इसलिए घोषणा `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` और `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; बराबर यात्राएं भूमिका-स्थानीय द्वारा संचालित होती हैं `test-login-oidc.js` और `test-login-native.js` चश्मा, जो में प्रवेश `/login` लॉग आउट Taigaस्वयं का नियंत्रण।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "ताइगा रीडायरेक्ट ``/`` जनता के लिए ``/discover`` शोकेस, जो एक नंगे लॉगइन लिंक प्रदान करता है लेकिन ओआईडीसी प्रविष्टि बिंदु नहीं; केवल ``/login`` एसएसओ निर्देशन को बांधता है (में टिप्पणी देखें ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` लॉग आउट Taigaस्वयं का नियंत्रण।."

