msgid "The Multisite variant in `meta/variants.yml <meta/variants.yml>`__ sets ``rbac.tenancy.axis: domain``, declares ``network-administrator`` and ``site-owner`` with ``scope: global``, keeps ``mcp`` global and declares the ``domains.served`` parent of the ``site-owner`` sites. `rbac_group_map.json.j2 <templates/rbac_group_map.json.j2>`__ builds every group path with ``rbac_group_path`` and hands the map to the mu-plugin as ``WORDPRESS_RBAC_GROUP_MAP``. A deploy that enables Multisite without ``rbac.tenancy.axis: domain`` fails in `tasks/00_core.yml <tasks/00_core.yml>`__ with a message naming the missing tenancy, before the role deploys anything."
