# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` instead. A lint that rejects the placeholder has to land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "एडाप्टर `digest` कुछ भी नहीं। सभी दस `implementation: adapter` भूमिकाएं समान प्लेसहोल्डर ले जाती हैं `sha256:` इसके बाद sixty-four शून्य, स्कीमा केवल उस उपसर्ग की जांच करती है और चल रही छवि को हल किया जाता है। `lookup('container_image', …)` इसके बजाय। एक ऐसा लिंट जो प्लेसहोल्डर को अस्वीकार करता है, उन्हें पहले की बजाय वास्तविक पाचन के साथ एक साथ उतरना पड़ता है।."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter is built from the upstream sources at ``services.keycloak_adapter.ref`` on the multi-arch ``denoland/deno`` image, with the role’s own `context.ts <./templates/keycloak_adapter/context.ts.j2>`__ baked in. `forwarded_scheme.ts <./files/keycloak_adapter/forwarded_scheme.ts>`__ rewrites the upstream ``adapter.ts`` at build time so the ``redirect_uri`` carries the scheme from ``X-Forwarded-Proto`` instead of a hard-coded ``https``, and fails the build when upstream moves one of the three rewritten lines. The web container serves ``/oidc/{redirect,auth,tokenize}`` through `nginx.conf.j2 <./templates/keycloak_adapter/nginx.conf.j2>`__ and the callback page ``/static/oidc-adapter.html`` from `oidc-adapter.html.j2 <./templates/keycloak_adapter/oidc-adapter.html.j2>`__. Enabling the switch on an existing inventory needs the ``jwt_app_secret`` credential, so regenerate the inventory first."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter is built from the upstream sources at `services.keycloak_adapter.ref` on the multi-arch `denoland/deno` image, with the role's own [context.ts](./templates/keycloak_adapter/context.ts.j2) baked in. [forwarded_scheme.ts](./files/keycloak_adapter/forwarded_scheme.ts) rewrites the upstream `adapter.ts` at build time so the `redirect_uri` carries the scheme from `X-Forwarded-Proto` instead of a hard-coded `https`, and fails the build when upstream moves one of the three rewritten lines. The web container serves `/oidc/{redirect,auth,tokenize}` through [nginx.conf.j2](./templates/keycloak_adapter/nginx.conf.j2) and the callback page `/static/oidc-adapter.html` from [oidc-adapter.html.j2](./templates/keycloak_adapter/oidc-adapter.html.j2). Enabling the switch on an existing inventory needs the `jwt_app_secret` credential, so regenerate the inventory first."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "एडाप्टर वह है जो बाध्य है। [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) नौ पढ़ने के उपकरण नाम `calendar`, `contacts` और `files` - तीन श्रेणियां जिनके अपस्ट्रीम `is_available` Unconditional है, इसलिए सेट भिन्न नहीं है जिसके साथ वैकल्पिक एप्लिकेशन एक तैनाती स्थापित करता है। `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` उस सूची के बाहर किसी भी उपकरण को मना कर देता है और किसी भी उपकरण को चिह्नित करता है `mutating` जबकि `mutating_tools_enabled` झूठा है, और अगर अनुबंध है तो यह सब शुरू करने से इनकार कर देता है `schema_sha256` फ़ाइल से मेल नहीं खाता है। इनकार पक्षकार में होता है, इसलिए यह प्रत्येक ग्राहक के लिए रखता है, भले ही प्रत्येक स्थानीय रूप से प्रस्तुत हो।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "एडाप्टर वह है जो बाध्य है। ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` फ़ाइल से मेल नहीं खाता है। इनकार पक्षकार में होता है, इसलिए यह प्रत्येक ग्राहक के लिए रखता है, भले ही प्रत्येक स्थानीय रूप से प्रस्तुत हो।."

