msgid "The app matches by email only, so the role gates that match on a verified address: web-app-discourse (the OIDC authenticator cannot match by username), web-app-shopware (AdminOpenAuth resolves the email first; the role gate refuses without `email_verified`) and web-app-semaphore (`GetUserByLoginOrEmail` keys on the address the `email_claim` template emits only while `email_verified` is true)."
