msgid "This page covers role-local CSS and theming. Use this page for repository wiring, inventory keys, and the design token contract. For implementation scope, override strategy, and live review, see the [`style.css` authoring skill](../../../../../agents/skills/i8-file-role-style/SKILL.md). For browser-side validation requirements after visible UI changes, see [Playwright Tests](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md)."
