msgid "Which engine renders into a language is deliberately not written here. The translation gateway offers each backend that serves the pair, falls through to the next one when an engine refuses or mangles the answer, drops an engine whose failures pile up, and settles a language on the engine that wins its comparisons. A static table beside that would be a second opinion that goes stale the moment the router learns something. What a single engine can do is declared with that engine instead: ``services.libretranslate-engine.serves`` of ``roles/svc-ai-libretranslate-engine`` states the codes its models cover, because the lane prefetches those models before any engine can be asked."
