msgid "With ``runs_tests``, whether any path changed. Else ``False`` when no deployed path is left; ``True`` when ``roles`` is empty, when a deployed path lies outside ``roles/`` or under one of ``roles``, or when the resolver output is the full sentinel or lists one of ``roles``; else ``False``."
