msgid "With the defaults the enrollment page lists FreeOTP, Google Authenticator and Microsoft Authenticator. Type ``hotp`` drops Microsoft Authenticator, and another algorithm, digit count or period leaves FreeOTP as the only app it lists. A credential keeps the type, algorithm, digits and period it was enrolled with, so a changed value of these reaches only credentials enrolled after the deploy. The look-ahead window and code reuse apply to every credential at once."
