msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` accepts a caller-supplied `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), and `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` accepts a caller-supplied `secret_id`. Both verified in [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (lines 889 and 1243)."
msgstr "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` कॉलर-supplied स्वीकार करता है `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), और `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` कॉलर-supplied स्वीकार करता है `secret_id`. दोनों में सत्यापित [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (रेखा 889 और 1243)।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PROJECT_ROOT` is the repo root derived from this file's location."
msgstr "`PROJECT_ROOT` इस फ़ाइल के स्थान से प्राप्त रेपो रूट है।."

msgid "`PUBLIC_BASE_URL` is not rendered into `templates/env.j2`, so the app falls back to `localhost`: every page links its feed and OpenSearch description as `https://localhost/index.xml` and `https://localhost/opensearch.xml` (measured on `/about`), and the bookmarklet on `/admin` is built from the same domain (upstream `src/routes/admin.js`). Option: render `PUBLIC_BASE_URL` from the role's canonical domain."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ is a minimal terminal coding agent with a lazy-loading skill system. This role installs it on a workstation and registers the platform’s model gateway as its provider."
msgstr "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ एक lazy-loading कौशल प्रणाली के साथ एक न्यूनतम टर्मिनल कोडिंग एजेंट है। यह भूमिका एक वर्कस्टेशन पर इसे स्थापित करती है और अपने प्रदाता के रूप में प्लेटफॉर्म के मॉडल गेटवे को पंजीकृत करती है।."

msgid "`Pool.Audit` on the agent pool"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ is an open-source systems monitoring and alerting toolkit that collects and stores time-series metrics and provides a powerful query language (PromQL)."
msgstr "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ एक ओपन सोर्स सिस्टम मॉनिटरिंग और अलर्टिंग टूलकिट है जो टाइम-सीरीज़ मेट्रिक्स को इकट्ठा और स्टोर करता है और एक शक्तिशाली क्वेरी भाषा प्रदान करता है (PromQL)।."

msgid "`Proxmox VE <https://www.proxmox.com/en/products/proxmox-virtual-environment/overview>`__ is an open-source virtualization platform built on Debian. It runs QEMU/KVM virtual machines, manages their storage, networks and resource pools, and serves a web UI and a REST API with fine-grained, pool-scoped permissions and API tokens."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pull requests`: **Read and write** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."
msgstr "`Pull requests`: **पढ़ना और लिखना** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `scripts/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` MAY के तहत मौजूद `scripts/` दस्तावेज़-केवल अपवाद के रूप में।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `utils/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` MAY के तहत मौजूद `utils/` दस्तावेज़-केवल अपवाद के रूप में।."

msgid "`REGISTRATION_OPEN` and `ALLOW_INVITE_REQUESTS` in `templates/env.j2` have no effect: BookWyrm v0.9.3 reads neither key (absent from `bookwyrm/settings.py`); registration and invite requests live in `SiteSettings.allow_registration` and `SiteSettings.allow_invite_requests` (the landing page shows the invite request form because the latter defaults to true). Options: drop both keys and the `registration_open`/`allow_invite_request` config, or converge the two `SiteSettings` fields in `files/python/site_design.py`."
