msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (डिफ़ॉल्ट: `noble`)"

