msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (डिफ़ॉल्ट: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ एक शक्तिशाली और सहज खुला स्रोत परियोजना प्रबंधन मंच है जो चुस्त टीमों के लिए तैयार है। क्या आप स्क्रम, कंबान या कस्टम हाइब्रिड वर्कफ़्लो का अभ्यास कर रहे हैं? Taiga एंटरप्राइज़ टूल की जटिलता के बिना, अपनी परियोजनाओं पर योजना बनाने, ट्रैक करने और सहयोग करने के लिए एक समृद्ध, अनुकूलन वातावरण प्रदान करता है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ एक आवेदन है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` कॉलर के टोकन के माध्यम से हल `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` और इसे बियरर के रूप में प्रस्तुत करता है"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Unit tests` verify isolated logic."
msgstr "`Unit tests` पृथक तर्क को सत्यापित करें।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`UsersLookup` yields the `no-reply` user dict used to derive `from` and `password`. Missing entries MUST yield an empty dict. The fallback for `from` is then `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."
msgstr "`UsersLookup` पैदावार `no-reply` उपयोगकर्ता dict निष्क्रिय करने के लिए इस्तेमाल किया `from` और `password`. मिसिंग प्रविष्टियों MUST एक खाली dict पैदा करते हैं। के लिए वापसी `from` तब है `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`।."

msgid "`VM.Config.Network`, `VM.Config.Disk`, `VM.Config.HWType`, `Sys.*` and every privilege outside the pool are left out, so the token cannot move a VM to another bridge, add a host or foreign-storage disk, or touch a VM outside the pool."
msgstr ""

msgid "`VersaTiles Map Animator <https://github.com/versatiles-org/versatiles-map-animator>`__ is a browser editor for keyframe camera animations on a `VersaTiles <https://versatiles.org/>`__ map. Its render server turns an animation into a video with a headless browser and ffmpeg, keeps a queue of render jobs per user, and offers the finished videos for download."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ एक व्यापक प्लगइन पारिस्थितिकी तंत्र के साथ एक शक्तिशाली स्रोत कोड संपादक है, जो कई भाषाओं और प्लेटफार्मों में विकास कार्यप्रवाह का समर्थन करता है। यह भी देखें `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ सामान्य `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ विकिपीडिया पर।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ एक चुनिंदा स्वाद में: वितरण Code OSS build, VSCodium, या Microsoft के अपने द्विआधारी."

msgid "`WEBSERVER_SECURITY_HEADERS` in [04_webserver.yml](../../group_vars/all/04_webserver.yml) holds the platform values. A role overrides any key under `security_headers` in its `meta/server.yml`; an inventory overrides it at `applications.<role>.server.security_headers`."
msgstr ""

msgid "`WM_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS` must name the fronting proxy's network, otherwise `X-Forwarded-For` is ignored and the per-IP LLM cap (50 calls per UTC day) counts the proxy as one client. Invalid values stop the container."
msgstr ""

msgid "`Wazuh <https://wazuh.com/>`__ is an open-source SIEM and XDR platform providing security monitoring, log analysis, intrusion and vulnerability detection, and compliance support."
msgstr ""

msgid "`Weblate <https://weblate.org>`__ is a web-based continuous localization platform. It keeps a translation memory, glossaries and a review workflow, so a human translation can be written once, approved, and reused everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgid "`WireGuard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ is an in-kernel VPN protocol. Peers authenticate each other with Curve25519 keypairs and exchange encrypted UDP datagrams, so a tunnel needs no session state, no certificate authority and no daemon of its own."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ एक बहुमुखी और व्यापक रूप से इस्तेमाल किया जाता है `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ वह लाखों वेबसाइटों को अधिकार देता है, ब्लॉग और पोर्टफोलियो से लेकर ई-कॉमर्स और कॉर्पोरेट साइटों तक। यह तैनाती एक कंटेनरीकृत प्रदान करती है WordPress उदाहरण के लिए मल्टीसाइट ऑपरेशन, उन्नत मीडिया प्रबंधन और व्यापक प्लगइन समर्थन के लिए अनुकूलित, जिससे आप पूरी तरह से समृद्ध सुविधाओं का लाभ उठा सकें WordPress सॉफ्टवेयर."

msgid "`Workflows`: **Read and write** (the pushed `main` carries `.github/workflows/**`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "`World Monitor <https://github.com/koala73/worldmonitor>`__ is a real-time global intelligence dashboard. It plots public news, conflict, aviation, shipping, natural hazard and market feeds on an interactive map and in configurable panels, and can summarise the situation through a language model."
