msgstr "`all.sh` आवश्यकता:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`all` (default)"
msgstr "`all` (डिफ़ॉल्ट)"

msgid "`all` is refused in swarm mode. Tor runs in its own network namespace there, so the fail-closed rules cannot tell its relay traffic from the traffic they must redirect."
msgstr ""

msgid "`all` needs a dnsmasq built with `nftset` (2.87 or newer) for direct host names; CentOS Stream 10 ships one without it, so there the deploy refuses direct host names and accepts addresses and CIDRs only. `all` is also refused in swarm mode, on a dnsmasq other drop-ins share or whose `/etc/dnsmasq.conf` names its own upstreams, on a dnsmasq that resolves as root or nobody or shares its UID, when the Tor group already exists on the host, and when `networks.internet.dns` lies inside the resolver set."
msgstr ""

msgid "`all` requires that svc-net-tor owns the dnsmasq listener; with foreign drop-ins the owner's upstreams would answer names in clearnet DNS."
msgstr ""

msgid "`all` routes all outbound traffic of the node through Tor and fails closed: nft drops every egress that goes neither to Tor nor to a direct destination, and every name outside the direct list resolves only through Tor's DNSPort. With Tor down, Tor-routed traffic fails; there is no clearnet fallback."
msgstr ""

msgid "`all` sends every outbound connection of the node and its containers through Tor and fails closed: TCP goes to the TransPort, every other protocol to an unlisted destination is dropped, and names outside the direct list resolve only through Tor's DNSPort. DNS reaches only loopback, the bridge and the deployed roles' own subnets, so no LAN resolver answers beside Tor; systemd-resolved, resolv.conf and the docker daemon lose their clearnet fallback. When Tor is down, that traffic fails; there is no clearnet fallback. Compose only."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`allow`: pre-authorized. Additionally, `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` pre-authorizes any Bash command that runs sandboxed and matches no `deny`/`ask` rule. Agents without an equivalent OS-level sandbox MUST treat unmatched Bash as `ask`."
msgstr "`allow`: पूर्व अधिकृत इसके अतिरिक्त, `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` किसी भी बैश कमांड को पूर्व-लेखित करता है जो सैंडबॉक्स को चलाता है और मैच नहीं करता है `deny`/`ask` नियम एक समतुल्य OS-लेवल सैंडबॉक्स के बिना एजेंट MUST ने बेजोड़ बैश के रूप में इलाज किया `ask`।."

msgid "`always_on`: the instance is ensured at deploy time and restarted when it exits."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ansible.builtin.package` ships as a documentation-only stub; its logic lives in Ansible's action plugin. The action plugin here executes modules directly, so it must swap this marker for the host's `ansible_facts.pkg_mgr`."
msgstr "`ansible.builtin.package` एक प्रलेखन-केवल स्टब के रूप में जहाज़; इसका तर्क Ansible के एक्शन प्लगइन में रहता है। यहां एक्शन प्लगइन सीधे मॉड्यूल को निष्पादित करता है, इसलिए इसे होस्ट के लिए इस मार्कर को स्वैप करना चाहिए `ansible_facts.pkg_mgr`।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ansible` (default)"
msgstr "`ansible` (डिफ़ॉल्ट)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "`ansible` (डिफ़ॉल्ट) रैप [मैट्रिक्स डोकर-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (एमडीए)MDAD रन ~70 Synapse, तत्व, हर समर्थित पुल, एलिमेंट कॉल और Jitsi वितरित करने के लिए अपस्ट्रीम उप-रोल। Infinito.Nexus एमडीएडी को प्रतिबद्ध करके पिन करें, एमडीएडी सूची से प्रस्तुत करें `services.matrix.*` knobs, और disables MDAD के बंडल ट्रेफिक / पोस्टग्रेस / Redis इसलिए केंद्रीय Infinito स्टैक को वापस सेवा देता है।."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`api.seaweedfs.s3.*` is the public S3 endpoint and is reachable without SSO gating."
msgstr "`api.seaweedfs.s3.*` सार्वजनिक S3 अंत बिंदु और SSO गेट के बिना पहुंच योग्य है।."

